submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Current behavior**\r\n<!-- Describe how the bug manifests. -->\r\nNesting ng-container in a transclusion results in the following error: \r\n\r\nTypeError: Cannot read property 'display' of undefined\r\n    at BaseFxDirectiveAdapter.BaseFxDirective._getDisplayStyle\r\n   ...\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n<!-- Describe what the behavior would be without the bug. -->\r\nThe ng-container would render its contents.\r\n\r\n**Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions**\r\nNest ng-container in a component that supports transclusion, like so:\r\n\r\n`<user-form [user]=\"user\" (submitted)=\"submitted($event)\">\r\n      <ng-container class=\"additional-actions\">\r\n        <button md-raised-button>\r\n          Button One\r\n        </button>\r\n        <button md-raised-button>\r\n          Button Two\r\n        </button>\r\n      </ng-container>\r\n    </user-form>`\r\n\r\nIt should be noted that the individual buttons can implement the \"additional-actions\" class directly, and the html will render without error:\r\n\r\n`<user-form [user]=\"user\" (submitted)=\"submitted($event)\">\r\n      <button class=\"additional-actions\" md-raised-button>\r\n        Button One\r\n      </button>\r\n      <button class=\"additional-actions\" md-raised-button>\r\n        Button Two\r\n      </button>\r\n    </user-form>`\r\n\r\n**What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?**\r\nAllow ng-container to render child content in a transclusion.\r\n\r\n**Please tell us about your environment:**\r\n@angular/cli: 1.0.0\r\nnode: 6.10.0\r\nos: win32 x64\r\n@angular/animations: 4.0.1\r\n@angular/common: 4.0.1\r\n@angular/compiler: 4.0.1\r\n@angular/core: 4.0.1\r\n@angular/flex-layout: 2.0.0-rc.1\r\n@angular/forms: 4.0.1\r\n@angular/http: 4.0.1\r\n@angular/material: 2.0.0-beta.3\r\n@angular/platform-browser: 4.0.1\r\n@angular/platform-browser-dynamic: 4.0.1\r\n@angular/router: 4.0.1\r\n@angular/cli: 1.0.0\r\n@angular/compiler-cli: 4.0.1\r\n\r\n* **Browser:** \r\nChrome, Version 57.0.2987.133 (64-bit)\r\n \r\n* **Language:**\r\nTypescript 2.2.0\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/16103/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/16103/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/530669084","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/18314#issuecomment-530669084","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/18314","id":530669084,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzMDY2OTA4NA==","user":{"login":"angular-automatic-lock-bot[bot]","id":54863671,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTQ4NjM2NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/40213?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/angular-automatic-lock-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events